    "content": "Lee Thompson Young (1984–2013) is best known for starring as the lead character in the Disney Channel series The Famous Jett Jackson from 1998 to 2001. He played a teenager who finds fame playing a secret agent in a TV show while trying to maintain a normal life. The series also featured a TV movie and solidified his place as a pioneer on the network. Key Facts About Lee Thompson Young's Disney Career: The Famous Jett Jackson: The show ran for three seasons and was a pioneering Disney live-action show. \"Silverstone\": He played dual roles in the show: Jett Jackson and his in-universe secret agent character, Silverstone. Jett Jackson: The Movie: A Disney TV movie based on the series. Other Roles: He also appeared in the Disney TV movie Johnny Tsunami and voiced a character in The Proud Family. Significance: Raven-Symoné cited him as a \"Disney Channel Legend\" and an early trailblazer on the network.",
